Follow the repository-wide instructions in `AGENTS.md`.

When changing LLM support, keep arbitrary model IDs editable, retain historical IDs as fallbacks, merge live `/api/v1/llm/models` discovery, and preserve Chat Completions, Responses, Anthropic Messages, and Gemini request paths. Provider-specific effort, speed, and verbosity values may be future tokens, but advanced options must never replace the advisory prompt, model, tools, or stream policy.

Python is the source of truth. Regenerate native parity contracts after changing Python catalogs or service contracts, and verify Python, Rust, C++, and Tauri consumers in proportion to the change.
